        <headline>REPEAT ITEM TRACKING</headline>
        <description>BACKGROUND:
 Multiple reports of a blocked LH aft (lav. D) toilet or that does not flush or does not stop to flush.
  
 ACTION:
 1. Obey safety precautions and get access to the aircraft.
  
 2. Do the fault isolation for the LH aft (lav. D) toilet that is blocked or does not flush. Refer to FIM 38-30 TASK 820.
  
 3. Replace the flush valve of the LH aft (lav. D) toilet. Refer to AMM 38-32-01-000-808-001 and 38-32-01-400-808-001.
 NOTE 
 
 
 Be careful when you tighten the nuts that attach the flush valve with the flange on the toilet elbow and support bracket.
 This step complies with TT 38-007.
 
 
  
 4. Record all findings in this workorder.
  
 5. Return the aircraft to service with all findings from this workorder documented and closed either through positive maintenance action or an acceptable deferral.</description>
